# Slime Against Humanity: create a 0/0 green Ooze creature token with trample and put X +1/+1 counters on it, X = 2 + the Oozes and Slimes you own in exile and your graveyard.
# With neither zone holding any, X is 2: an Ooze token that is 2/2 with trample (a 0/0 that had no counters would die; one with two stays).

[Bot1 Deck]
Slime Against Humanity
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Forest x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

